          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat p=287/500=0.574$ (so option C, 87%, is wrong — that would confuse $X$ with a percentage). The alternative is $p<0.6$, i.e. ONE-sided (option B wrong). $$z_0=\\frac{\\hat p-p_0}{\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}}=\\frac{0.574-0.6}{\\sqrt{0.6(0.4)/500}}=\\frac{-0.026}{0.0219089}=-1.1867$$ Rejection region: $z_0<-1.645$. Since $-1.1867>-1.645$ we FAIL to reject $H_0$ (option A wrong). Only the value of the statistic, $-1.1867$, is correct.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat p=287/500=0.574$ (nên phương án C, 87%, sai). Đối thuyết là $p<0.6$, tức MỘT phía (phương án B sai). $$z_0=\\frac{0.574-0.6}{\\sqrt{0.6(0.4)/500}}=\\frac{-0.026}{0.0219089}=-1.1867$$ Miền bác bỏ: $z_0<-1.645$. Vì $-1.1867>-1.645$ nên KHÔNG bác bỏ $H_0$ (phương án A sai). Chỉ giá trị thống kê $-1.1867$ là đúng.</p></div>"
