          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$$z_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}}=\\frac{24.5-21.3}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{100}{10}+\\dfrac{25}{15}}}=\\frac{3.2}{\\sqrt{10+1.6667}}=\\frac{3.2}{\\sqrt{11.6667}}=\\frac{3.2}{3.4157}=0.9369$$ Note the variances (not the standard deviations) are divided by the sample sizes.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$$z_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}}=\\frac{3.2}{\\sqrt{10+1.6667}}=\\frac{3.2}{3.4157}=0.9369$$ Lưu ý phải chia PHƯƠNG SAI (không phải độ lệch chuẩn) cho cỡ mẫu.</p></div>"
